ashmir, India, running beneath the Patnitop range between…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/chencang"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/chencang.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Chencang</span><span class="enc-type">Place</span><span class="enc-snip">Chencang was an ancient county in the Wei river valley of Shaanxi, China, near present-day Baoji.</span></a></li></ul>
